657	     * Derive the version-2 region code used INSIDE the owner's identifiers: the canonical region
658	     * (see {@link #deriveRegion}) with the fixed {@code V2} version tag mixed in as a prefix (e.g.
659	     * {@code NSW} becomes {@code V2NSW}). Mixing the tag into the region guarantees the member id it
660	     * feeds differs from any version-1 member id. The plain canonical region is used unchanged for
661	     * the user-facing {@code locality}, {@code timezone} and the owner segment, so the {@code V2} tag
662	     * never leaks outside the identifiers.
663	     *
664	     * @param postcode the owner's postcode, may be {@code null}
665	     * @param city     the owner's city
