725	     * The fiscal year that the given date falls in. The fiscal year starts on 1 July, so a date in
726	     * July to December belongs to the fiscal year ending in the following calendar year, and a date
727	     * in January to June belongs to the fiscal year ending in the same calendar year. The fiscal
728	     * year is identified by that ending calendar year (e.g. 1 July 2026 to 30 June 2027 is 2027).
