869	     * Normalize an optional owner email address. A blank/absent value is treated as "not provided"
870	     * and returns {@code null}. When present, the value must be a syntactically valid address; if it
871	     * is not, an {@link InvalidRequestException} is thrown (mapped to 400 Bad Request). A valid value
872	     * is returned lower-cased.
